1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,000
Umuulan. May silbi
pa ba ang solar mo?

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,220
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:08,850
Oo, pero mas
mahina ang output.

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,750
Kapag maulap, nababawasan
ang liwanag sa panels.

5
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:16,540
Kaya bumababa ang output,
minsan malaki ang bawas.

6
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:20,310
Pero madalas hindi zero, dahil
may diffuse light pa rin.

7
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:26,160
Ang tamang tingin: kWh sa
buong buwan, hindi isang araw.

8
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:32,570
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

9
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:35,100
Life is SoLight with Solar.
